BlastEm 1.0.0 packaging
=======================

This package tracks the upstream v1.0.0 release at commit
c258a70cb7efd722077af1a47a9fd1d05f0635a6 (2026-09-11).

Create the matching orig tarball from a clean repository with:

    git archive --format=tar \
      --prefix=blastem-1.0.0/ \
      c258a70cb7efd722077af1a47a9fd1d05f0635a6 | \
      xz -9e > ../blastem_1.0.0.orig.tar.xz

Upstream reports version 1.0.0 directly, so no downstream version-identification
patch is needed. The build-flags patch ensures that dpkg-buildflags hardening
and reproducibility flags are not overwritten by the upstream Makefile.
